<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一行带有模因的文字，会使观察者产生极度反感并拒绝记忆位于与项目之前的内容。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>各类书籍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>未被完全收容<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以下为一个典型范例</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">收起</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<h3><span>要求全文背诵</span></h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00335" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00335-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925501" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1595921948 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 Jul 2020 07:39</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00297/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个深蓝色的16K笔记本，厚度约为4.815cm。其封面的右上角有一个<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">月牙形</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">上弦月形</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">满月形</span> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">下弦月形</span> 表现形式会受10m内的任意被书写于纸上的日期影响的月亮图案。笔记本的内页是纯白色，无任何可辨识字迹。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>位于██街██号的一家破旧文具店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">置于Site-██的低价值储物室</span> Site-██公共区域的一张靠墙放置的桌子上，作为墙上挂历的辅助工具<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>“我终于知道为什么那个家伙在我做记录时莫名其妙地在旁边狂撕了二十几页日历” ——研究员████<br />
“因为健忘的主管██████似乎没告诉你这个笔记本的完整情况，所以我就想让你更直观的感受一下它的‘独特之处’。本质上我是在帮助你的说” ——研究员██</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00297" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00297" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00297-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ghostwood" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6411077); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6411077&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925501" alt="GhostWood" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6411077)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ghostwood" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6411077); return false;">GhostWood</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1593847480 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">04 Jul 2020 07:24</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00220/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一组基金会制斯克兰顿现实稳定锚（SRA）。其在直接视觉观察上与普通船锚无异。将其作为船锚使用时会使作用船只永久锚定于当前位置。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Area-CN-██收容设施<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被就地收容于Area-CN-██。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>这就是<a href="/scp-cn-1730">SCP-CN-1730</a>漂在海上还能完全不动的原因？</em>——Dir. ██████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00220" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00220" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00220-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-hormress" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4142571); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4142571&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608925501" alt="Dr Hormress" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4142571)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-hormress" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4142571); return false;">Dr Hormress</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1590666363 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">28 May 2020 11:46</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00416/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个手枪用枪口消音器，在手枪安装该消音器时，射出的子弹材质会变成巧克力。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/03/2█<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>被邮寄到研究员咸鱼的宿舍中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>成为研究员咸鱼的私人物品<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>看我巧克力子弹！——研究员咸鱼<br />
有病吧……——Dr.████</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00416" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00416" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
